$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=gamlmom  LOC_AFTER=?

* The weighted Gamma line moment, truncated: ` S. ( -u T (,) T ) |Gamma ( X + i u )| ( 1 + |u| ) ^ 2 _d u <_ 1024 H / log 2 ` for any strip constant ` H ` of ~ gamstrb and any ` T `, with a bound independent of ` T `.  This is ` integral_norm_Gamma_line_le ` of Route Z's GammaStrip.lean in truncated form (C4 blueprint 0.2 deviation 5); the integrability of the integrand is a hypothesis because set.mm has no continuity of ` _G ` on a line.

